Reassess explicitly selected saved evidence offline, with scoped claims

Usage: pqc-scan assess [OPTIONS] --input-format <INPUT_FORMAT> --as-of <AS_OF> --out-dir <OUT_DIR> <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  One saved JSON file; never scanned or executed

Options:
      --input-format <INPUT_FORMAT>  Explicit inventory-v1, tls-v1, ssh-offers-v1 or ssh-kex-v1
      --as-of <AS_OF>                Explicit evaluation instant with UTC offset and whole seconds
      --context <CONTEXT>            Scoped migration-context-v1 file; old assessment context is separate
      --out-dir <OUT_DIR>            
      --lang <LANG>                  Initial HTML and Markdown language: en or ja [default: en]
  -h, --help                         Print help
